e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-f0004-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-a43ad189cc8f2f18e67f","layer":"pei","quote":"为朗陵侯相","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c347ca05b53d613cd76d","start":27,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o001","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-5430515d00c8a91a0cac","layer":"original","quote":"荀彧字文若，颍川颍阴人也〖1〗。祖父淑，字季和，朗陵令〖2〗；当汉顺、桓之间〖3〗，知名当世。有子八人，号曰“八龙”。彧父绲，济南相；叔父爽，司空。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p001","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-a43ad189cc8f2f18e67f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《续汉书》曰：“淑，有高才，王畅、李膺皆以为师。为朗陵侯相，号称‘神君’。”","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c347ca05b53d613cd76d","start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p002","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9e7f1bade3933fa1462b","layer":"pei","quote":"张璠《汉纪》曰：“淑，博学有高行，与李固、李膺同志友善；拔李昭于小吏，友黄叔度于幼童。以贤良方正，征。对策讥切梁氏，出补朗陵侯相。卒官。八子：俭、绲、靖、焘、（诜）〔汪〕、爽、肃、旉。音敷。爽字慈明。幼好学，年十二，通《春秋》、《论语》。耽思经典，不应征命，积十数年。董卓秉政，复征爽；爽欲遁去，吏持之急。诏下郡，即拜平原相；行至苑陵，又追拜光禄勋；视事三日，策拜司空。爽起自布衣，九十五日而至三公。淑旧居西豪里，县令苑康曰‘昔高阳氏有才子八人’，署其里为‘高阳里’。靖字叔慈。亦有至德，名几亚爽，隐居终身。”","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c347ca05b53d613cd76d","start":0,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
